<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Holyman half year net profit jumps.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Holyman half year net profit jumps.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year to June 30</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    14.01 vs 9.41</p>
<p>    Net				     15.03 vs 6.79</p>
<p>    Interim dividend (cents)	   8.00 vs 6.00</p>
<p>    Sales				   41.95 vs 28.95</p>
<p>    Other income			  54.38 vs 10.32</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)			   21.18 vs 11.00</p>
<p>    Abnormal items		  gain 9.27 vs nil</p>
<p>Dividend is 100 percent franked</p>
<p>Pay date Oct 8  </p>
<p>Reg date Sep 24</p>
<p>    Tax					7.09 vs 2.58</p>
<p>    Interest				 3.12 vs 0.49</p>
<p>    Depreciation			   4.95 vs 2.49</p>
<p>    Minorities			     1.16 vs 0.04</p>
<p>NOTE: Holyman is a shipping group.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 373 1800</p>
</text>
